  The article is truncated and does not clearly state that the meeting was held 'in' Rasipuram town or that all parties attended; the draft's claim that all recognized parties participated and the 'meeting held yesterday' timing rest partly on the cut-off text (article says 'நேற்று' so timing is supported, but the attendance claim 'அனைத்து கட்சியினர் கலந்துகொண்டனர்' is an inference from 'அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட அனைத்து கூட்டம்' which is garbled)
