factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The article never states the city as Namakkal; the draft's headline, reel_script and slides_spec add 'நாமக்கல்' as the location (the article only gives the address 'திரு.வி.க., ரோடு, முனிசிபல் காலனி' and the head office is said to be in that area without naming the town).
  The article says the chief guest is 'ராஜ்ஜிய சபா எம்.பி., ராஜேஸ்குமார்' but describes him only as attending; the draft says he 'கலந்துகொள்கிறார்', which is consistent, but the article also says the opening is presided over by Engineer Raja, Sudarvannan, Paranitharan and Baskar, and this important detail (who presides) is missing from the reel_script.
  The article says the head office is at 'திரு.வி.க., ரோடு, முனிசிபல் காலனி' and the new branch is near a marriage hall; the draft's reel_script says the branch is on 'திரு.வி.க. ரோடு, முனிசிபல் காலனியில்' which conflates the head office location with the new branch location.
  The article says the offer applies at the Rasipuram branch, but the draft's caption and reel_script present the offer as tied to the new branch opening, mixing the Rasipuram branch offer with the new branch event in one sentence.
